<!doctype html><html lang="az"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %> · print</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"><script src="/app.js" defer></script></head>
<body class="qr-print"><div class="qr-sheet">
<p class="eyebrow">Baku Bible Institute · Davamiyyət · Attendance</p>
<h1><%= sec.code %> · <%= sec.title %></h1>
<p class="qr-sub">Həftə <%= code.week_no %> · Dərs <%= code.week_no %>/<%= attqr.SESSIONS %> — Week <%= code.week_no %> · Session <%= code.week_no %> of <%= attqr.SESSIONS %></p>
<img src="<%= qr %>" alt="QR check-in code" class="qr-img">
<p class="qr-date"><%= attqr.fmtAz(code.valid_from) %> – <%= attqr.fmtAz(code.valid_until) %> (Bakı vaxtı, UTC+4)</p>
<p>Telefonunuzun kamerası ilə skan edin, daxil olun — davamiyyətiniz avtomatik qeyd olunacaq.<br><span class="muted">Scan with your phone camera and sign in; your attendance is recorded automatically.</span></p>
<p class="noprint"><button class="btn" type="button" data-print>Print</button> <a href="<%= base %>">Back</a></p>
</div></body></html>
